Correction discovered while investigating CI, not the root cause of the failing jobs: cleanup could delete a live .staging-* directory while a concurrent build was still writing it.

Correction: one bounded registry tracks up to 32 active staging artifacts, derived from the existing root-entry reserve. Cleanup skips active paths but still removes abandoned staging directories; Drop unregisters and cleans incomplete builds.

Regression coverage: cleanup_preserves_an_active_staging_artifact fails deterministically without the guard and passes with it.

